    schema:longitude "16.318911"^^xsd:decimal ;
    fdo:context "Self-built (own design, no commercial set) by Daria Stefan (TU Wien). Shown at the Apothekertrakt of Schönbrunn Palace during CHNT31, 2026-11-12 (https://www.openstreetmap.org/relation/6892072). Identification as a Maya-style stepped pyramid with a temple was confirmed by the builder. A specific model such as El Castillo (Chichén Itzá) is NOT confirmed." ;
    dct:type _:heritage_object_object_type0_1 ;
    fdo:documentationPurpose "Test case for FDOx packaging of a scan and its reconstruction." ;
    fdo:acquisitionMethod "KIRI Engine (structure from motion photogrammetry), latest app version on 2026-11-12 (no version number shown in the app)" ;
    fdo:acquisitionHardware "Samsung Galaxy A71" ;
    fdo:acquisitionImagesCount "115" ;
    dct:provenance "KIRI Engine export (OBJ with MTL and JPG texture). 53,482 triangles and 26,996 vertices after merging duplicate vertices; not watertight; unit unknown; rotated by about 16 degrees against the ground, compressed along one axis by a factor of about 0.72, ground plane included; no clean-up applied."  .

