<https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24305428> schema:description "Photogrammetric 3D scan (KIRI Engine) of a stepped LEGO pyramid with four grey stair arms (seven levels) and a small temple with four corner pillars on top, a hobby build by Daria Stefan (TU Wien); scanned on 2026-11-12 in the Apothekertrakt of Schönbrunn Palace, Vienna, where the model was on display during the CHNT31 conference. Raw scan without clean-up. The paired reconstruction is a separate FDOx and derives from this one." .
